01:06:38,933 --> 01:06:40,603
She's really fast. They're at the same pace.

2020
01:06:41,233 --> 01:06:42,372
Gosh, Brother Shin Young.

2021
01:06:42,373 --> 01:06:43,842
Brother? Hold on.

2022
01:06:43,843 --> 01:06:45,343
Come on. That was bad.

2023
01:06:47,113 --> 01:06:50,343
(Speeding Brother Shin Young)

2024
01:06:53,153 --> 01:06:54,313
She makes a good turn too.

2025
01:06:57,153 --> 01:06:58,582
- It's a reset for us. - She's in first place.

2026
01:06:58,583 --> 01:07:00,123
(She even turned the tables.)

2027
01:07:01,223 --> 01:07:02,293
- Gosh. - She's fast.

2028
01:07:02,993 --> 01:07:04,162
- Come in! - She's too fast.

2029
01:07:04,163 --> 01:07:06,292
Here. Run!

2030
01:07:06,293 --> 01:07:07,362
All right.

2031
01:07:07,363 --> 01:07:09,302
All right. Let's go!

2032
01:07:09,303 --> 01:07:11,332
- He's running at full speed. - What?

2033
01:07:11,333 --> 01:07:12,532
Let's go.

2034
01:07:12,533 --> 01:07:13,633
Ji Hyeon.

2035
01:07:14,603 --> 01:07:17,003
He was fast.

2036
01:07:18,243 --> 01:07:19,343
All right. Let's go!

2037
01:07:21,213 --> 01:07:23,383
- Gosh, it's a monkey. - Mr. Saru.

2038
01:07:24,283 --> 01:07:25,342
- The monkey expression... - Mr. Saru!

2039
01:07:25,343 --> 01:07:26,413
wasn't on point.

2040
01:07:27,053 --> 01:07:28,183
- It's Mr. Saru. - Mr. Saru.

2041
01:07:28,353 --> 01:07:29,353
Mr. Saru.

2042
01:07:29,354 --> 01:07:30,523
- Mr. Saru! - He's really fast.

2043
01:07:31,223 --> 01:07:33,653
- Go! - Nice!

2044
01:07:33,923 --> 01:07:35,223
Run!

2045
01:07:36,893 --> 01:07:38,093
Gosh, what is this?

2046
01:07:40,163 --> 01:07:41,892
(Flailing due to the parachute's air resistance)

2047
01:07:41,893 --> 01:07:43,533
The air resistance was stronger than expected.

2048
01:07:44,603 --> 01:07:45,762
Oh, no.

2049
01:07:45,763 --> 01:07:46,903
(Feeling bad for her)

2050
01:07:47,003 --> 01:07:49,843
- Fruitping! - Fruitping!

2051
01:07:50,073 --> 01:07:51,873
- "Fruitping?" - We all had our own characters.

2052
01:07:52,003 --> 01:07:53,942
- What kind of ping were you? - Eyeballping.

2053
01:07:53,943 --> 01:07:55,043
Eyeballping?

2054
01:07:56,113 --> 01:07:57,743
- Ji Hyeon! - Go!

2055
01:07:57,983 --> 01:07:59,413
Nice!

2056
01:08:00,913 --> 01:08:02,852
- He ran well. - He did well.

2057
01:08:02,853 --> 01:08:04,322
- CODE KUNST! - Go!

2058
01:08:04,323 --> 01:08:05,823
(CODE KUNST, Ji Hyeon)

2059
01:08:06,393 --> 01:08:07,552
Wait a minute.

2060
01:08:07,553 --> 01:08:10,823
(Pink Velvet is over a half lap behind.)

2061
01:08:11,293 --> 01:08:12,962
(Screaming)

2062
01:08:12,963 --> 01:08:15,763
- Fruitping! - Fruitping!

2063
01:08:15,933 --> 01:08:18,503
Fruitping!

2064
01:08:19,303 --> 01:08:22,103
- It's okay. You finished it. - It's okay.

2065
01:08:22,273 --> 01:08:23,302
Here. Put it on.

2066
01:08:23,303 --> 01:08:24,942
- Put it on. - They're just having fun with it.

2067
01:08:24,943 --> 01:08:26,042
- You go. - Run!

2068
01:08:26,043 --> 01:08:27,542
That's it.

2069
01:08:27,543 --> 01:08:29,583
Let's go! Run!

2070
01:08:31,143 --> 01:08:32,243
Let's go!

2071
01:08:32,783 --> 01:08:35,183
Bum June...

2072
01:08:35,883 --> 01:08:37,022
Let's go!

2073
01:08:37,023 --> 01:08:40,353
(Screaming)

2074
01:08:42,123 --> 01:08:43,223
Bum June runs well.

2075
01:08:43,593 --> 01:08:45,293
He's really fast.

2076
01:08:46,363 --> 01:08:48,292
(Screaming)

2077
01:08:48,293 --> 01:08:49,403
Here we go!

2078
01:08:50,903 --> 01:08:52,063
Eyeballping is off.

2079
01:08:52,433 --> 01:08:53,633
I did my best.

2080
01:08:56,003 --> 01:08:58,702
(Skipping)

2081
01:08:58,703 --> 01:09:00,513
- It was fun. - Eyeballping.

2082
01:09:01,443 --> 01:09:02,812
Nice. You got it. You can go.

2083
01:09:02,813 --> 01:09:04,783
(In the fierce relay race...)

2084
01:09:06,613 --> 01:09:08,712
- She's jogging? - Oh, no.

2085
01:09:08,713 --> 01:09:09,923
(Jogging relaxedly)

2086
01:09:10,183 --> 01:09:12,423
You're doing well.

2087
01:09:12,553 --> 01:09:15,422
- You're doing well. - You did it.

2088
01:09:15,423 --> 01:09:16,493
- You did it. - Run!

2089
01:09:16,593 --> 01:09:19,362
(What's more important than the race is the princesses' dignity.)

2090
01:09:19,363 --> 01:09:20,893
- "The princesses' dignity?" - "The princesses' dignity?"

2091
01:09:21,133 --> 01:09:22,492
- It's okay. - Let's go!

2092
01:09:22,493 --> 01:09:23,633
What's important is finishing the race.

2093
01:09:24,933 --> 01:09:26,402
(Meanwhile, Between Power and Ham and Team Five-Way Intersection...)

2094
01:09:26,403 --> 01:09:27,533
(are neck and neck.)

2095
01:09:28,333 --> 01:09:29,502
Go!

2096
01:09:29,503 --> 01:09:30,973
- Here. - Hold it for him.

2097
01:09:31,603 --> 01:09:32,843
- Go! - Kian84!

2098
01:09:33,013 --> 01:09:34,113
The team leader!

2099
01:09:35,243 --> 01:09:36,283
Kian84!

2100
01:09:36,483 --> 01:09:37,712
- Goodness. - Hey!

2101
01:09:37,713 --> 01:09:39,242
I couldn't put it on.

2102
01:09:39,243 --> 01:09:40,782
I know. It's harder than it looks.

2103
01:09:40,783 --> 01:09:41,813
- You're rushed too. - I couldn't put it on.

2104
01:09:42,653 --> 01:09:44,583
(Surprised)

2105
01:09:46,293 --> 01:09:47,322
Hey!

2106
01:09:47,323 --> 01:09:48,993
- He took off his cap right away. - He's so cool.

2107
01:09:49,793 --> 01:09:51,462
With Fun Run's pride on the line.

2108
01:09:51,463 --> 01:09:53,533
Proper Runner versus Fun Runner!

2109
01:09:53,733 --> 01:09:54,733
Fun Runner wins.

2110
01:09:54,734 --> 01:09:55,793
Proper Runner versus Fun Runner!

2111
01:09:58,103 --> 01:09:59,203
Go!

2112
01:10:00,673 --> 01:10:01,932
- Okay, Na Ra! - Na Ra!

2113
01:10:01,933 --> 01:10:03,042
(Na Ra turns the tables.)

2114
01:10:03,043 --> 01:10:04,573
- He turned the tables. - He turned the tables?

2115
01:10:05,443 --> 01:10:07,713
Na Ra runs fast in short-distance races.

2116
01:10:09,783 --> 01:10:11,613
Next! Who's next?

2117
01:10:12,083 --> 01:10:13,212
- It's not me. - Na Ra, go one more time.

2118
01:10:13,213 --> 01:10:14,283
He has to go one more time.

2119
01:10:14,653 --> 01:10:15,752
(The last runner, Na Ra)

2120
01:10:15,753 --> 01:10:18,183
The fifth runners are the aces of their teams.

2121
01:10:18,483 --> 01:10:19,792
- That's right. - We have MINHO. We'll win.

2122
01:10:19,793 --> 01:10:21,092
- Since we have MINHO... - It's MINHO!

2123
01:10:21,093 --> 01:10:22,152
- It's not me. - Go one more time.

2124
01:10:22,153 --> 01:10:23,293
He has to go one more time.

2125
01:10:24,063 --> 01:10:25,162
Let's go!

2126
01:10:25,163 --> 01:10:27,863
- Right away? - What? He's running one more time?

2127
01:10:28,863 --> 01:10:29,932
It's MINHO!

2128
01:10:29,933 --> 01:10:32,002
(Ace MINHO sets off.)

2129
01:10:32,003 --> 01:10:33,133
- All right. - Go, MINHO!

2130
01:10:33,633 --> 01:10:34,772
Go now!

2131
01:10:34,773 --> 01:10:36,033
We must win!

2132
01:10:36,173 --> 01:10:37,473
- What was that? - So that's how he ran.

2133
01:10:38,603 --> 01:10:39,642
He's no joke.

2134
01:10:39,643 --> 01:10:40,673
- What was that? - So that's how he ran.

2135
01:10:41,273 --> 01:10:43,182
- Are you sure he put it on? - What's with him?

2136
01:10:43,183 --> 01:10:44,613
(Chasing furiously against the air resistance)

2137
01:10:44,983 --> 01:10:46,183
Gosh, it's MINHO.

2138
01:10:47,413 --> 01:10:48,513
Gosh, MINHO is fast.

2139
01:10:49,623 --> 01:10:50,823
You're almost there!

2140
01:10:51,383 --> 01:10:52,423
Na Ra!

2141
01:10:52,953 --> 01:10:54,053
He's so fast.

2142
01:10:55,223 --> 01:10:56,923
Na Ra lost all his energy.

2143
01:10:57,093 --> 01:10:58,563
He did two laps by himself.

2144
01:10:59,433 --> 01:11:01,533
He runs so well. Goodness.

2145
01:11:02,493 --> 01:11:03,833
Na Ra, hang in there!

2146
01:11:04,203 --> 01:11:05,502
You can do it!

2147
01:11:05,503 --> 01:11:06,932
Goodness. But...

2148
01:11:06,933 --> 01:11:07,933
MINHO!

2149
01:11:07,934 --> 01:11:10,072
Look. MINHO is no joke.

2150
01:11:10,073 --> 01:11:12,203
- He ran so well. - Na Ra is tired.

2151
01:11:13,013 --> 01:11:14,213
First place!

2152
01:11:14,873 --> 01:11:16,212
We won first place!

2153
01:11:16,213 --> 01:11:17,442
(Team Five-Way Intersection won.)

2154
01:11:17,443 --> 01:11:18,513
We did it.

2155
01:11:18,643 --> 01:11:20,083
You got this.

2156
01:11:20,653 --> 01:11:21,753
Gosh, that was amazing.

2157
01:11:22,083 --> 01:11:24,622
Well done.

2158
01:11:24,623 --> 01:11:26,393
(He lost by a hair.)

2159
01:11:26,923 --> 01:11:29,022
(Disappointed)

2160
01:11:29,023 --> 01:11:30,222
- We're in second place, right? - Yes, we are.

2161
01:11:30,223 --> 01:11:31,323
Well done.

2162
01:11:31,523 --> 01:11:34,062
- After a lap, - It's really tiring.

2163
01:11:34,063 --> 01:11:35,532
I was almost out of energy.

2164
01:11:35,533 --> 01:11:36,662
- Right. - Of course it's tiring.

2165
01:11:36,663 --> 01:11:37,663
- It's tiring. - You ran two laps.

2166
01:11:37,664 --> 01:11:39,032
- Your leg gave way, right? - When Na Ra came in...

2167
01:11:39,033 --> 01:11:40,373
after two laps,

2168
01:11:40,673 --> 01:11:42,502
he aged in that short amount of time.

2169
01:11:42,503 --> 01:11:43,672
- All of a sudden. - That's right.

2170
01:11:43,673 --> 01:11:45,542
- His dark circles were darker. - They were.

2171
01:11:45,543 --> 01:11:46,672
He got more under-eye fat.

2172
01:11:46,673 --> 01:11:47,912
(Joking)

2173
01:11:47,913 --> 01:11:50,382
- Goodness. - It was all sunken like sink holes.

2174
01:11:50,383 --> 01:11:52,643
- You should reposition it. - Goodness.

2175
01:11:53,053 --> 01:11:54,152
Well done.

2176
01:11:54,153 --> 01:11:56,982
(Still, you did well.)

2177
01:11:56,983 --> 01:11:59,852
- Where are we? - Our ace just set off.

2178
01:11:59,853 --> 01:12:01,153
- Oh, really? Who is it? - Yes.

2179
01:12:04,123 --> 01:12:05,222
Hey!

2180
01:12:05,223 --> 01:12:09,193
(The last princess, Moorincess, sets off.)

2181
01:12:10,833 --> 01:12:12,132
You got to walk...

2182
01:12:12,133 --> 01:12:13,402
- the red carpet by yourself. - Of course.

2183
01:12:13,403 --> 01:12:14,432
A solo shot.

2184
01:12:14,433 --> 01:12:16,542
- He's coming in by himself. - Princesses love solo shots.

2185
01:12:16,543 --> 01:12:18,943
(Everyone's attention is on Moorincess.)

2186
01:12:19,203 --> 01:12:21,572
- Yaho! - Yaho!

2187
01:12:21,573 --> 01:12:23,013
Princesses' stroll?

2188
01:12:23,113 --> 01:12:25,142
- Our princess. - A stroll.

2189
01:12:25,143 --> 01:12:26,283
Well done.

2190
01:12:26,453 --> 01:12:27,783
He had a Fun Run.

2191
01:12:28,213 --> 01:12:29,353
I had a Fun Run there too.

2192
01:12:30,083 --> 01:12:31,282
Their team...

2193
01:12:31,283 --> 01:12:33,352
- Yes! - Good job.

2194
01:12:33,353 --> 01:12:34,752
At the end, when you were neck and neck...

2195
01:12:34,753 --> 01:12:37,362
MINHO ran like an engine.

2196
01:12:37,363 --> 01:12:39,223
- He wins every time he plays. - He beat the wind.

2197
01:12:40,863 --> 01:12:42,693
Gosh, we should've taken turns. It was a fail.

2198
01:12:43,203 --> 01:12:44,262
(Making Na Ra go 4th and 5th was a failed strategy.)

2199
01:12:44,263 --> 01:12:45,833
Running two laps in a row must've been really tiring.

2200
01:12:47,103 --> 01:12:48,533
(Groaning)

2201
01:12:49,173 --> 01:12:50,372
- Oh, no, Sung Hwan. - It was really hard on Sung Hwan,

2202
01:12:50,373 --> 01:12:51,543
- and I was also... - Oh, no...

2203
01:12:52,573 --> 01:12:54,472
- It was really hard. - We thought of the parachute...

2204
01:12:54,473 --> 01:12:55,512
too easily.

2205
01:12:55,513 --> 01:12:57,543
- That's right. - I thought it'd be nothing.

2206
01:12:58,913 --> 01:13:00,013
Gosh, a comeback win.

2207
01:13:01,313 --> 01:13:03,483
- Who is that? - I didn't think it was you.

2208
01:13:04,423 --> 01:13:06,122
It's the person from the drawing.

2209
01:13:06,123 --> 01:13:08,393
(The person from the drawing)

2210
01:13:09,123 --> 01:13:10,192
That's not true.

2211
01:13:10,193 --> 01:13:11,563
- I drew that. - They look the same.

2212
01:13:12,863 --> 01:13:15,893
By the way, Shin Young was really fast.

2213
01:13:16,063 --> 01:13:17,362
I was really surprised.

2214
01:13:17,363 --> 01:13:18,703
You came in first.

2215
01:13:19,103 --> 01:13:21,032
- She did track and field. - She was a track and field athlete.

2216
01:13:21,033 --> 01:13:23,002
- She was a track and field athlete. - When I was in seventh grade.

2217
01:13:23,003 --> 01:13:24,403
You were really fast.

2218
01:13:24,773 --> 01:13:26,672
I did track and field in seventh grade.

2219
01:13:26,673 --> 01:13:28,572
Then I switched to judo.

2220
01:13:28,573 --> 01:13:30,243
- It wasn't just judo. - That's how it was.

2221
01:13:30,483 --> 01:13:33,882
Everyone knew MINHO would run well.

2222
01:13:33,883 --> 01:13:35,252
- He's really fast. - But...

2223
01:13:35,253 --> 01:13:36,922
it never occurred to us that Shin Young would be fast.

2224
01:13:36,923 --> 01:13:38,552
- That's right. - Everyone thought I was expendable.

2225
01:13:38,553 --> 01:13:40,492
- We thought she'd be caught up. - I thought so too.

2226
01:13:40,493 --> 01:13:43,062
If Shin Young didn't run like this, your team would've won.

2227
01:13:43,063 --> 01:13:44,663
- That's right. - That's right.

2228
01:13:46,463 --> 01:13:47,533
Hold on.

2229
01:13:48,433 --> 01:13:49,433
What is it?

2230
01:13:50,203 --> 01:13:51,563
- One of us... - Yes?

2231
01:13:52,133 --> 01:13:54,002
- ran... - Yes.

2232
01:13:54,003 --> 01:13:56,702
without the parachute on for a certain distance.

2233
01:13:56,703 --> 01:13:57,802
- What? - Who is it?

2234
01:13:57,803 --> 01:13:59,672
- Who is it? - There's a VAR in pro sports games.

2235
01:13:59,673 --> 01:14:00,773
Who is it?

2236
01:14:01,173 --> 01:14:03,113
- VAR. - Who is it?

2237
01:14:04,143 --> 01:14:06,213
- Hold on. - Isn't it Kian84?

2238
01:14:06,483 --> 01:14:08,383
- No. - Come on.

2239
01:14:08,983 --> 01:14:10,923
- He did wear it. - Wait.

2240
01:14:11,653 --> 01:14:13,122
- He ran without it. - No.

2241
01:14:13,123 --> 01:14:14,452
He was wearing it.

2242
01:14:14,453 --> 01:14:16,222
- Oh, for this section. - Look at that.

2243
01:14:16,223 --> 01:14:18,093
- He ran without wearing it. - He ran too far.

2244
01:14:18,193 --> 01:14:20,762
- That's not it. Look. - He ran...

2245
01:14:20,763 --> 01:14:22,293
around 1.5m without wearing it.

2246
01:14:23,103 --> 01:14:24,432
That's why we stopped.

2247
01:14:24,433 --> 01:14:26,202
- We were supposed to... - Wait.

2248
01:14:26,203 --> 01:14:27,372
- wear it properly. - That's right.

2249
01:14:27,373 --> 01:14:28,532
- For sure. - Then we could run.

2250
01:14:28,533 --> 01:14:30,302
He ran while carrying it.

2251
01:14:30,303 --> 01:14:31,702
- Who is it? - No, he put his arms through it.

2252
01:14:31,703 --> 01:14:33,013
- No way. - Disqualified!

2253
01:14:33,213 --> 01:14:34,912
- Come on. - Come on.

2254
01:14:34,913 --> 01:14:36,273
- Let's go. - Come on.

2255
01:14:36,943 --> 01:14:39,113
- Come on. - Seriously.

2256
01:14:39,413 --> 01:14:40,453
It's a red card.

2257
01:14:40,813 --> 01:14:42,353
(Bitter)

2258
01:14:42,913 --> 01:14:43,983
How about one more round for a rematch?

2259
01:14:44,553 --> 01:14:45,653
How about one more round for a rematch?

2260
01:14:45,923 --> 01:14:47,853
- No. We can't. - Darn it.

2261
01:14:48,593 --> 01:14:49,823
Stop it already.

2262
01:14:50,393 --> 01:14:52,323
It's Lee Gye In.

2263
01:14:53,233 --> 01:14:55,792
Father.

2264
01:14:55,793 --> 01:14:58,763
A few of us are down, feeling ill.

2265
01:14:59,003 --> 01:15:00,303
No, I won't run.

2266
01:15:00,833 --> 01:15:02,103
All right. Let's have a rematch.

2267
01:15:02,203 --> 01:15:04,002
- I'm sorry. - A rematch.

2268
01:15:04,003 --> 01:15:05,842
- Sorry about that. - You said okay without hesitation.

2269
01:15:05,843 --> 01:15:07,443
- I was cool about it. - You were cool about it.

2270
01:15:07,543 --> 01:15:09,242
- Let's have a rematch. - A rematch!

2271
01:15:09,243 --> 01:15:11,013
- Are you okay with a rematch? - Yes.

2272
01:15:11,843 --> 01:15:13,353
- Gosh. - Should I run two laps in a row?

2273
01:15:13,453 --> 01:15:15,213
No. Then...

2274
01:15:15,813 --> 01:15:17,252
- You should go second. - Second.

2275
01:15:17,253 --> 01:15:18,783
- Second. - I'll go third.

2276
01:15:19,483 --> 01:15:21,423
- Four, five. - You'll go second and fifth.

